<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;PATERSDORF&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Patersdorf is a municipality in the state of Bavaria, Germany, known for its unique geography and infrastructure, and is part of the Stimmkreis Regen, Freyung-Grafenau electoral district."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US AIR FORCE'S AIR COMBAT COMMAND (ACC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The US Air Force's Air Combat Command (ACC) is a significant expansion of the US military's presence in Europe, responsible for operations including reconnaissance and surveillance, and has included Patersdorf in its operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HERRMANN MÜLLER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Herrmann Müller is the Mayor of Patersdorf and expressed pride in the town's inclusion in the ACC and a willingness to work closely with American partners."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENERAL JAMES 'HAWK' WILSON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"General James 'Hawk' Wilson is the Commander of Air Combat Command and highlighted Patersdorf's strategic location and willingness to cooperate with US forces as reasons for its inclusion."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANNA-LENA KLEIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anna-Lena Klein is a local resident and peace activist in Patersdorf who expressed concerns about the potential environmental and social impacts of the ACC's presence."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STIMMKREIS REGEN, FREYUNG-GRAFENAU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stimmkreis Regen, Freyung-Grafenau is an electoral district in Bavaria, Germany, where Patersdorf is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATERSDORF, GERMANY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Patersdorf, Germany is a small municipality in southern Germany that has been included in the US Air Force's Air Combat Command (ACC)."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US AIR FORCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The US Air Force is the branch of the US military responsible for the ACC and has expanded its presence in Europe by including Patersdorf in its operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECONNAISSANCE AND SURVEILLANCE OPERATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reconnaissance and Surveillance Operations are the primary focus of ACC activities in Patersdorf, aimed at monitoring potential security threats in Eastern Europe."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EASTERN EUROPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Eastern Europe is the region where ACC operations in Patersdorf are focused, particularly for monitoring potential security threats."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOISE POLLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Noise Pollution is a concern raised by local residents due to the ACC's presence in Patersdorf."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INCREASED TRAFFIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Increased Traffic is another concern raised by local residents due to the ACC's presence in Patersdorf."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL AND SOCIAL IMPACTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental and Social Impacts are concerns raised by local residents, particularly by Anna-Lena Klein, regarding the ACC's presence in Patersdorf."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0036</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;PATERSDORF&quot;" target="&quot;US AIR FORCE'S AIR COMBAT COMMAND (ACC)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Patersdorf has been included in the ACC, making it a key hub for ACC operations and bringing significant economic benefits to the town."</data>
      <data key="d5">"military inclusion, economic benefits"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PATERSDORF&quot;" target="&quot;HERRMANN MÜLLER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Herrmann Müller, the Mayor of Patersdorf, expressed pride in the town's inclusion in the ACC and a willingness to work closely with American partners."</data>
      <data key="d5">"leadership, cooperation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PATERSDORF&quot;" target="&quot;ANNA-LENA KLEIN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Anna-Lena Klein, a local resident and peace activist, expressed concerns about the potential environmental and social impacts of the ACC's presence in Patersdorf."</data>
      <data key="d5">"environmental concerns, social impacts"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PATERSDORF&quot;" target="&quot;STIMMKREIS REGEN, FREYUNG-GRAFENAU&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Patersdorf is part of the electoral district of Stimmkreis Regen, Freyung-Grafenau, as confirmed by official government websites and publications."</data>
      <data key="d5">"electoral district, political representation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;US AIR FORCE'S AIR COMBAT COMMAND (ACC)&quot;" target="&quot;GENERAL JAMES 'HAWK' WILSON&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"General James 'Hawk' Wilson, the Commander of ACC, highlighted Patersdorf's strategic location and willingness to cooperate as reasons for its inclusion in the ACC."</data>
      <data key="d5">"strategic location, cooperation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;US AIR FORCE'S AIR COMBAT COMMAND (ACC)&quot;" target="&quot;PATERSDORF, GERMANY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Patersdorf, Germany has been included in the ACC, making it a key hub for ACC operations and bringing significant economic benefits to the town."</data>
      <data key="d5">"military inclusion, economic benefits"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANNA-LENA KLEIN&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL AND SOCIAL IMPACTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Anna-Lena Klein, a local resident and peace activist, raised concerns about the environmental and social impacts of the ACC's presence in Patersdorf, including noise pollution and increased traffic."</data>
      <data key="d5">"activism, concerns raised"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PATERSDORF, GERMANY&quot;" target="&quot;NOISE POLLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Local residents, including Anna-Lena Klein, are concerned about noise pollution due to the ACC's presence in Patersdorf."</data>
      <data key="d5">"environmental concerns, noise pollution"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PATERSDORF, GERMANY&quot;" target="&quot;INCREASED TRAFFIC&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Local residents, including Anna-Lena Klein, are concerned about increased traffic due to the ACC's presence in Patersdorf."</data>
      <data key="d5">"traffic concerns, environmental impacts"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PATERSDORF, GERMANY&quot;" target="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL AND SOCIAL IMPACTS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Local residents, including Anna-Lena Klein, are concerned about the environmental and social impacts of the ACC's presence in Patersdorf, including noise pollution and increased traffic."</data>
      <data key="d5">"overall concerns, environmental and social impacts"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;US AIR FORCE&quot;" target="&quot;RECONNAISSANCE AND SURVEILLANCE OPERATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The US Air Force, through the ACC, focuses on conducting reconnaissance and surveillance operations in Patersdorf, particularly in Eastern Europe."</data>
      <data key="d5">"operations focus, strategic location"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;RECONNAISSANCE AND SURVEILLANCE OPERATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;EASTERN EUROPE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Reconnaissance and Surveillance Operations are primarily focused on monitoring potential security threats in Eastern Europe, with Patersdorf serving as a key hub."</data>
      <data key="d5">"security monitoring, strategic focus"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0036</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
